<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring bids remain mixed.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring bids remain mixed.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dark northern spring wheat values and soft white bids were mixed on Wednesday as dealers noted very little movement in parts of the Northern Plains and Pacific Northwest.</p>
<p>&quot;Producers are hanging on tight,&quot; an Oregon dealer said. He also pointed to a lack of sizable export activity, particularly in soft white wheat.</p>
<p>December MGE spring wheat futures gained three cents to end at $4.10-1/2 a bushel.  </p>
